{"3818520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ollie and the Merchant of Dreams", "steam_appid": 3818520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/fc0a496f54c45ca9e1c8769948b0c99b.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical world of Hitonero is crumbling. Dreams, the lifeblood of creation, have stopped flowing, and feral monsters now roam the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/0614cdfd7bed5434bba0e93b6e435ae7.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/0614cdfd7bed5434bba0e93b6e435ae7.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/0614cdfd7bed5434bba0e93b6e435ae7.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Ollie, the Catfolk Scout from Kindleburg</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ollie, a nimble catfolk scout, and journey through a collapsing 2D Metroidvania of agile platforming, dynamic swordplay, divine powers, and hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/a64b9454157ac04ffaef29617ca132e7.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=384 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/a64b9454157ac04ffaef29617ca132e7.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/a64b9454157ac04ffaef29617ca132e7.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Pantheon of Archons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ancient Archons, each embodying a force of reality, and earn boons that change how you fight, move, and explore. Scale walls, levitate over traps, bounce off ceilings, unlock magical doors to forgotten areas, summon a giant snake and a feral wolf, ride inside mighty golems, master witchcraft and soar across the world on a flying mount.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/c08a48a1f2705efbded7ef9ccd0447fd.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/c08a48a1f2705efbded7ef9ccd0447fd.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/c08a48a1f2705efbded7ef9ccd0447fd.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/36bf9e906e1f1f08791349695800f7bf.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/36bf9e906e1f1f08791349695800f7bf.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/36bf9e906e1f1f08791349695800f7bf.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of Hitonero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across handcrafted realms, from the Dryadic Forest and Pretty Swamp to levitating islands, buried temples, godly prisons, and sealed sanctuaries. Explore a deeply interconnected world filled with relics, shortcuts, pets, secrets, optional encounters, and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bd5b821d2ba810656869e9b68b5aa02d.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bd5b821d2ba810656869e9b68b5aa02d.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bd5b821d2ba810656869e9b68b5aa02d.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bb6c31cac8f2d923bae868740148df38.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bb6c31cac8f2d923bae868740148df38.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bb6c31cac8f2d923bae868740148df38.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ollie, a sword-wielding catfolk hero in a pixel art world of magical creatures, hidden lore, and winding paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an interconnected world where each region has its own secrets, atmosphere, music, and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your sword as you meet new NPCs that unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon the Archons, divine beings whose powers shape combat, traversal, and progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master wall jumps, levitation, quick dodges, and ceiling flips to reach new routes and outmaneuver enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a winged steed across distant areas and dive into shoot ’em up sequences integrated in this metroidvania adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a towering stone golem and collect flying pets that change the way you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the story through multiple endings, including a hidden true ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your sword, find ancient relics, and uncover forgotten history through lore cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a secret minigame to break the pace or improve your odds against tough bosses.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/fc0a496f54c45ca9e1c8769948b0c99b.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical world of Hitonero is crumbling. Dreams, the lifeblood of creation, have stopped flowing, and feral monsters now roam the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/0614cdfd7bed5434bba0e93b6e435ae7.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/0614cdfd7bed5434bba0e93b6e435ae7.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/0614cdfd7bed5434bba0e93b6e435ae7.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Ollie, the Catfolk Scout from Kindleburg</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ollie, a nimble catfolk scout, and journey through a collapsing 2D Metroidvania of agile platforming, dynamic swordplay, divine powers, and hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/a64b9454157ac04ffaef29617ca132e7.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=384 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/a64b9454157ac04ffaef29617ca132e7.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/a64b9454157ac04ffaef29617ca132e7.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Pantheon of Archons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ancient Archons, each embodying a force of reality, and earn boons that change how you fight, move, and explore. Scale walls, levitate over traps, bounce off ceilings, unlock magical doors to forgotten areas, summon a giant snake and a feral wolf, ride inside mighty golems, master witchcraft and soar across the world on a flying mount.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/c08a48a1f2705efbded7ef9ccd0447fd.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/c08a48a1f2705efbded7ef9ccd0447fd.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/c08a48a1f2705efbded7ef9ccd0447fd.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/36bf9e906e1f1f08791349695800f7bf.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/36bf9e906e1f1f08791349695800f7bf.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/36bf9e906e1f1f08791349695800f7bf.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of Hitonero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across handcrafted realms, from the Dryadic Forest and Pretty Swamp to levitating islands, buried temples, godly prisons, and sealed sanctuaries. Explore a deeply interconnected world filled with relics, shortcuts, pets, secrets, optional encounters, and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bd5b821d2ba810656869e9b68b5aa02d.poster.avif?t=1788181487\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bd5b821d2ba810656869e9b68b5aa02d.webm?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/extras/bd5b821d2ba810656869e9b68b5aa02d.mp4?t=1788181487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co