 power. Claim six ancient beings, use their abilities to fight, move, and unlock hidden paths, and uncover a sinister plot threatening the world.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/0026249f18d54c282f7922eb2184d302843df14d/header.jpg?t=1788181487", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/cb4f97342a79a4a53d4445df600eae826f0f92c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788181487", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818520/cb4f97342a79a4a53d4445df600eae826f0f92c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788181487", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 / AMD Ryzen 7 (3.0 GHz or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 / RTX 3050 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> GPU supporting OpenGL 4.1 or later required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 / AMD Ryzen 7 (3.0 GHz or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 / RTX 3050 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> GPU supporting OpenGL 4.1 or later required</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Lavadrop Entertainment"], "publishers": ["Lavadrop Entertainment"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1799, "final": 1799, "discount_pe